    "name": {
      "value": "The Beating"
    },
    "source": {
      "value": "sf2"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "The Beating symbolizes attack from all sides. If you have The Beating invested, whenever you and an ally are flanking a foe, your melee Strikes gain a +2 item bonus to damage. This increases to a +3 item bonus at 17th level. You wave the card to conjure up dozens of violent ghostly figures; you cast pernicious poltergeist, and the area of the spell is treated as difficult terrain in addition to its normal effects. The level of the spell is one-half your level, rounded down (minimum 6th level), and the save DC is your class DC."
    },
